    "Issue #10788. A loading screen counts as a return even when no update sees it. Narcolepsy 901841's",
    "proof reply arrives 1 s after its reminder; the player then teleports to another map. With no new",
    "reply the curse is still held 12 s later, past the 10 s return window, so the old proof was",
    "dropped; it lands only after a reply to its new reminder."
  ],
